Beautiful movie.

Just raw emotions from the two main characters. Everything is so subtle making those breaking points hit that much harder. Seeing myself in both of them at times and wanting to be the other but realizing the grass isn't always greener. They both share the struggle of understanding your own insecurities and finding it hard to open up, covering it each in their own ways.

> I love him, and I hate him, and I want to be him.
